OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of specially made
OL,8,     Frecordings, including highlights
OL,9,     Ffrom the Royal Philharmonic
OL,10,     FOrchestra and chamber music from
OL,11,     FSt. Magnus Festival.
OL,12,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,13,     FFrom Norwich Cathedral, with music
OL,14,     Fby Bairstow, Stanford and Harwood.
OL,15,G1600 Composer of the Week: Barber
OL,16,     F4/5. Donald Macleod delves into a
OL,17,     Fperiod when Samuel Barber starts
OL,18,     Flooking to old compositions as
OL,19,     Finspiration for new ones.
