OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FThe BBC Singers with conductor
OL,7,     FAshley Grote and cello soloist Guy
OL,8,     FJohnston in a concert from Norwich
OL,9,     FCathedral inspired by two notable
OL,10,     Fwomen with historic links to the
OL,11,     Fcity.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: The Dawn of Music
OL,13,     FWhen did we learn to make melody
OL,14,     Ffrom stone and bone? Archaeologist
OL,15,     FDr Brenna Hassett unearths the
OL,16,     Forigins of human music. Today,
OL,17,     Fshe's looking at some hard
OL,18,     Fevidence.
